### Collection Priority
| Source Category | Priority | Legal Risk | Value |
|----------------|----------|-----------|-------|
| Public records (WHOIS, DNS, CT) | High | None | High |
| Social media (public profiles) | Medium | Low | Medium |
| Technical (Shodan, Censys) | High | None | High |
| Dark web / leaks | Low | Medium | Variable |

## 9. Methodology

### Collection Workflow
1. **Passive Recon**: DNS, WHOIS, CT logs, Google dorks
2. **Social Media**: Profile enumeration, network mapping
3. **Technical**: Shodan/Censys, port history, tech stack
4. **Deep Dive**: Dark web monitoring, leaked credentials check
5. **Analysis**: Correlation, timeline, attribution
6. **Reporting**: Structured findings, IOCs, recommendations

