## 12. Reporting Format

### Report Structure
1. Executive Summary (for non-technical audience)
2. Target Overview
3. Methodology
4. Findings by Target
5. Risk Assessment
6. IOC List (for defensive use)
7. Recommendations
8. Appendices (raw data, tool output)

### Classification
| Level | Handling | Distribution |
|-------|---------|-------------|
| TLP:RED | Named recipients only | Client POC only |
| TLP:AMBER | Organization only | Client org |
| TLP:GREEN | Community | Security community |
